{"ID":"20240220132610-pa5b3un","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132610-pa5b3un","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132610-pa5b3un\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170637-f37aed1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170729-1kwv96d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170744-d4knnos\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:44,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:44\u0026#125;","title":"【抵挡汤】(抵当汤)\u0026amp;【抵当丸】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312170744"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312170637-f37aed1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-f37aed1","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百三十八条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170637-7zfwipx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-7zfwipx","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳病」,六七日表证乃在,下之,脉微而沉,反不结胸,其人发狂者,以热在下焦,少腹当鞕满,小便自利者,下血乃愈．所以然者,以「太阳」随经,瘀热在裹故也。「抵当汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170637-t9mq1lt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-t9mq1lt","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个人表症仍有，应该发表，结果不小心攻下。这个攻下不见的是医生攻下，有时是吃坏肚子。“脉微而沉”本来表症是浮的脉，浮在表，现在沉，反不结胸，其人发狂者。前面介绍的是如狂，看起来好像要狂，但是还没有狂，那是血在膀胱里面。这里发狂是已经发狂了，神智不容易控制、焦躁。“以热在下焦,少腹当鞕满,”鞭就是硬的意思。硬块，你摸到非常硬。大便出来像鞭，这个鞭不是硬，是像鞭子。为什么形容像鞭，摸病人肚子，摸到硬邦邦的一条，就是鞭满。“小便自利者,”小便都很好，代表膀胱没有问题。可能就呆在子宫里面了，男人就是腹腔里面。下血乃愈．为什么呢？以「太阳」随经,瘀热在裹故也。「抵当汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170637-wsbmjj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-wsbmjj1","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"抵当汤这个药很骏。真正在使用抵当汤的时候，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用在妇人子宫里面有肿块，肿瘤。男人腹腔里面血结住。有时候外伤伤到，小便很好啊，这说明膀胱里面没有血，腹腔里面有淤血。抵当汤吃下去血会从大便排出来，大便是黑的。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170637-dhrbfr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-dhrbfr0","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"抵当汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170637-qgi97qe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-qgi97qe","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"水蛭三十个熬，虻虫三十个去翅，桃仁二十个去皮尖，大黄三两酒洗（浸）。右四味,以水五升,煮取三升,去滓,温服一升,不下再服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170637-ekknhk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-ekknhk5","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吸血的水蛭，小小细细像一个小铁钉一样。虻虫，牛虻，生长在牛棚专门叮牛，指甲大小。水蛭、虻虫都是吸血的，这两个药碰在一起非常凶。可以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，肿块里面的淤血，它会把它吸收掉。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中医用动物药的时候，用动物的性，比如背后膏肓痛，膏肓痛是淤血在里面，放血火罐拔掉就好了，过去有人用水蛭治膏肓痛，放身上，有淤血的时候，它吸你的脏血，不会吸你的好血，天性如此。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170637-y80hc2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-y80hc2i","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血症第一个方子就是桃核承气汤，第二个方子就是抵当汤。抵当汤主症就是瘀热在里，少腹当鞭，小便自利，代表膀胱里面没有问题，专对子宫。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"古时案例，妇人怀孕，子宫有肿瘤，肿瘤和胎儿一起长，压迫小孩子长不大，抵当汤下去，淤血排出去，肿块消除，小孩子就长大。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170637-0cmn9i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-0cmn9i2","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"水蛭越细越小越好，虻虫越大越好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170637-9mv5a6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-9mv5a6t","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈逊斋氏曰：盖少腹硬满,有「血结」,有「水结」,有「水血两结」。「血结」必见狂妄。小便是利的，病人发狂，用「抵当汤」。小便不利的，病人如狂，还没有真正的发狂，用「桃核承气汤证」。「水结」，如果水结下焦，必小便不利,「五苓散证」是也。「水血两结」必小便难,少腹满如墩状,如「大黄甘遂汤证」是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170637-zah9jgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-zah9jgn","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"东洞翁本方定义曰：治有瘀血者,凡有瘀血者有二：少腹鞕痛而小便快利者,其一：腹不满而其人自觉满者,这都是有淤血在里面。其二。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"急则以汤,缓则以丸。急症的时候用抵当汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。病人你怎么知道他血结在里面，肚子感觉胀满，摸摸看没有胀满，如果是膀胱有尿胀满，肚子会胀的，可是他肚子平平软软的，就是觉得里面很胀，那就是里面有淤血。小便不利者就是瘀血在膀胱,就是桃核承气汤,小便快利者就是抵当汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170637-kffpmpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-kffpmpu","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈自明与此方中去「大黄」加「地黄」用之,这个人如果大便很通利，大黄不需要了，我们改成地黄，配上这几个攻坚的药的话，补泻兼顾，同时可以把子宫里面淤血攻掉，同时把血补回来。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170637-bblxhr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170637-bblxhr6","updated":"20240312170637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一种症状叫「"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"干血劳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"」。病人表现的表证就是小腿上「"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肌肤甲错"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"」。长得像鱼鳞，只有小腿这一段变的很干。这个代表腹部有干血，血干在里面了。就可以把大黄拿掉，换地黄。如果说这个人又便秘，你就还是用抵当汤，加地黄上去。因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"地黄有增润津液的功能。因为他太干了，你去增润他一点津液的时候，它变湿了、变滑了你去把它清掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。有干血劳的时候你可以用。子宫里面有干血劳在里面的时候，因为子宫是血室，直接落到肝经，子宫又是受奶水下降的地方。所以如果有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"干血劳的人，你如果不把它治好，他的乳癌的机率会比较高"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。因为奶水下来，没有办法完全停在子宫里面，可能有干血劳堵到一部分，奶水还有一部分累积到乳房里面。干血劳在腹部也能看到，大部分是在小腿。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170744-lh8qp9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170744-lh8qp9e"}},{"ID":"20240312170744-egzbfbb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170744-egzbfbb","updated":"20240312170744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百三十九条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170744-y36vqqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170744-y36vqqo","updated":"20240312170744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳病」,身黄,脉沉结,少腹鞕,小便不利者,为无血也；小便自利者,其人如狂者,血证谛也,「抵当汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170744-sbnbee8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170744-sbnbee8","updated":"20240312170744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太阳病，脉应该是浮的，但现在脉是沉在里面的。遇到贫血的病人不是一味开补血的药就好的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瘀不去，新不生"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你一定要查造成瘀的原因，把源头去掉才会好。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"绝大多数贫血都便秘，清便秘，大便一正常，胃口一恢复，补血药还没开，光吃饭血就补回来了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170744-hackkiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170744-hackkiq","updated":"20240312170744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床遇到久病、癌症都会有淤血。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170744-d4knnos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170744-d4knnos","updated":"20240312170744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"附骨脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：你手摸他的脉，摸下去沉到骨边才摸到它，你按它越按跳的越快。附骨脉就是里面有阴实。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170717-efyl6dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170717-efyl6dv"}},{"ID":"20240312170718-fjhsmm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170718-fjhsmm9","updated":"20240312170718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百四十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170718-0amgfkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170718-0amgfkd","updated":"20240312170718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」,有热,少腹满,应小便不利,今反利者,为有血也,当下之。不可余药,宜「抵当丸」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170718-fqadp9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170718-fqadp9t","updated":"20240312170718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是发现病的时候赶快下。这个是抵当丸。抵当丸是少腹满，没有鞭满，硬满，很强烈的。抵当丸症比抵当汤症稍微轻一点，不是那么急，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"急的时候要用汤。缓的时候用丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170718-7r5kklm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170718-7r5kklm","updated":"20240312170718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"抵当丸方"}]},{"ID":"20240312170718-5uq12ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170718-5uq12ly","updated":"20240312170718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水蛭二十个熬，虻虫二十五个熬,去翅，桃仁二十个去皮尖，大黄三两酒浸右四味,杵分为四丸,以水一,煮一丸,取七合服之,晬时当下血,若不下者,更服。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170718-h58quas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170718-h58quas","updated":"20240312170718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4——2"}]},{"ID":"20240312170718-kd8kw43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170718-kd8kw43","updated":"20240312170718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"抵当丸与抵当汤处方一样，只是做成丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170638-sdfdwfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170638-sdfdwfx"}},{"ID":"20240312170609-1gxxx97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170609-1gxxx97","updated":"20240312170609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百五十二条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170609-rtkldbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170609-rtkldbg","updated":"20240312170609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明证」，其人善忘者，必有蓄血，所以然者，本有久瘀之血，故令善忘;矢虽鞕，大便反易，其色必黑，宜「抵当汤」下之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170609-yur2dzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170609-yur2dzz","updated":"20240312170609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「抵当汤」代表里面有淤血。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"血症最明显的症状就是渴不欲饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170609-h65gusi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170609-h65gusi","updated":"20240312170609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诊断的时候，问"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大便黑色，代表里面有淤，在排淤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们在治肝病的时候，不管是肝硬化还是肝癌都时候，大便都是黑色，因为在排毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170609-04yjkrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170609-04yjkrd","updated":"20240312170609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“善忘”可以看灵枢第八十篇大惑论，提到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上气不足，下气过实，其人善忘"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，人如果说阳明燥矢，大便都堵在肠子里，或者下焦有湿热，大便堵到也是一样。上焦是虚的恶，这个时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"血气没有办法供应到上焦，到心肺脑部去，就会产生善忘的现象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。常常忘东忘西的，看看他大便好不好。如果上气能够补足，善忘就会治好。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170609-fyqf933","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170609-fyqf933","updated":"20240312170609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个人善忘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有蓄血，下焦是实，大便堵到，用抵当汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一般是腹腔有淤血，或者里面肿瘤有淤血。如果是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"膀胱有淤血堵到，会小便不利，这个时候处方，是桃核承气汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。桃核承气汤是调胃承气汤加上桃仁跟桂枝。抵当汤就会用到水蛭，蟒虫这种东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170609-1z408el","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170609-1z408el","updated":"20240312170609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遇到淤血用抵当汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"抵当汤是张仲景出的第二个活血化瘀的处方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个处方一定要有这个症，善忘，大便黑色的，一定有蓄血。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170609-f9uzldp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170609-f9uzldp","updated":"20240312170609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般我们在穴道触诊的时候，三阴交会找到压痛点。还有舌头上齿痕很多也是有淤血。正常人舌头平平整整的，如果有人舌头边上齿痕很多，代表有淤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170609-r7z64p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170609-r7z64p2","updated":"20240312170609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240307090750-9vxe3lc.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240312170609-8bap10u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170609-8bap10u","updated":"20240312170609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6——5"}]},{"ID":"20240312170609-sktoe0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170609-sktoe0r","updated":"20240312170609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正常人舌头是平整的，有淤血的他的舌头齿痕很多，代表内有淤血。口渴不欲饮，这都是有淤血。这都是抵当汤的使用时机。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170623-7z4apmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170623-7z4apmb"}},{"ID":"20240312170729-8eqimtu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170729-8eqimtu","updated":"20240312170729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百七十二条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170729-qgwrous","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170729-qgwrous","updated":"20240312170729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：病人无表里证，脉浮数者，虽发热六七日至七八日，勿下之。假令已下，脉数，不解，不大便者，有瘀血，宜「抵当汤」。若脉数，不解，而下不止，必协热而便脓血也。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170729-0l5rd99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170729-0l5rd99","updated":"20240312170729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“脉浮数者”浮代表表，数代表热。就是表热，不要攻下。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170729-awzv18u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170729-awzv18u","updated":"20240312170729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果遇到病人没有解表，直接攻下，造成协热痢，就是葛芩连汤症。便脓血，本来这个人病在表，攻下跑到里去了，或者没有把病治好，他跑到肠胃里面去了，就变成肠病毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170729-1kwv96d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170729-1kwv96d","updated":"20240312170729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"攻里的时候只要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有淤血要用抵当汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。没有淤血还是承气汤。"}]}]}